CORE
main.c
--allow-pointer-unsoundness --32 --no-assertions --datarace --unwind 2 --rounds 2 --no-por
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
precondition_instance.*FAILURE
--
No race, but free() of a non-heap pointer: under --datarace only races
count. The library precondition made the answer FAILED, reported as a race
(the adutux driver, no-data-race, expected true). Fails without the fix.
